      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"It's been a year\". They can't even spend 10 minutes doing some of the simple things. Give them another year to switch the collision based buttons to UI buttons. Even something as simple as that has not been done in a year. Just add it to the list of things that should take less than 30 minutes to fix but have not been done in months.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
