      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's a Ryzen 1700 with an overclocked XFN RX580. I usually drop to 45fps with two people on screen or when I turn a mirror on even by myself. That seems to be particular to my Oculus or something. It will drop to 45 and stay there, like it's locked to 45fps, until there are a lot of people in the room, unless the room sucks.\n\nTurning the camera on shouldn't eat half my frames when it's really only rendering me and maybe a couple of people in frame. Maybe if the resolution could be set on it it might help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
