      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "my specs are as follows:\nFX-8350 with a 1050ti. \ni've had no problems with the camera and TECHNICALLY you should have better hardware then i do. hell in some worlds, i can still push 90 ez with the stream camera out.",
      "viewerReactions": null
