      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Vive or Oculus? I'm still tweaking my system to try and make it run better. Single core specs on the 8350 may be better than on the multi core focused 1700. My 8320 would be stable at 4.1Ghz, but my 1700 is running at 3.65Ghz with factory overclock.\n\nIt may also tie into the memory leak issues. I was in that room for an hour before the framerate dropped to unplayable levels, which is when I clipped the video. Private room, maybe 5 people had joined while a couple of others had left.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
