  "details": "It's been a year, I think, since the camera system came out, and it's about time to take another look at it. From button fixes to optimization to more/different options for it, how about we see what can be done with the new unity upgrade? Here's a clip demonstrating the current state of the stream camera. 17fps with it on (this was making the image in my headset shake like mad), max frames just by turning it off. https://clips.twitch.tv/PlumpLitigiousArtichokePanicVis",
